  beatId: D6
  description: "More atoms, one after another. Every one absorbs the same wavelength
    \u2014 that is what hydrogen does \u2014 but the spectrum has carried the last
    mark redward by the time the next arrives, so each atom cuts its own line and
    a row of them builds up. This is a forest forming."
